   1  TIM2+F+I+R3    1.4545  TIM2{1.98079,19.6623,10.2348}+F{0.210329,0.345939,0.224307,0.219424}+I{0.349339}+R3{0.603154,1.06753,0.0456484,6.61521,0.0018581,29.1385}
   2  TN+F+I+R3      0.9013  TN{17.6389,8.38712}+F{0.236124,0.348714,0.18277,0.232392}+I{0.474778}+R3{0.496708,1.50928,0.0267508,7.38257,0.00176354,29.9613}

